    "questions": [
      {
        "id": 12870,
        "quiz_id": 2169,
        "type": "writing",
        "title": "These days, there’s no need to go to watch live performances (eg. a show or a concert) because what we can see on TV or computer screens is better.  To what extent do you agree or disagree?",
        "status": "draft",
        "content_writing": "<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AEFFdxmxAolUJKxfxRolsJxigpf\"><em><strong>These days, there&rsquo;s no need to go to watch live performances (e.g. a show or a concert) because what we can see on TV or computer screens is better. </strong></em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IL7rdgaH0oGKnpxlnk2lRbktg2g\"><em><strong>To what extent do you agree or disagree?</strong></em></div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NTzNd8mj9oUwbFx0MFilTG8bg97\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 2 - Live Shows vs Screens</em></p>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NTzNd8mj9oUwbFx0MFilTG8bg97\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1. Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li>Đề b&agrave;i Live Shows vs Screens&nbsp;đưa ra một &yacute; kiến l&agrave; \"Kh&ocirc;ng cần thiết phải đi xem biểu diễn trực tiếp (<strong>live performances</strong>) nữa, v&igrave; xem qua TV hay m&agrave;n h&igrave;nh m&aacute;y t&iacute;nh c&ograve;n tốt hơn\". Đề b&agrave;i hỏi liệu bạn đồng &yacute; hay kh&ocirc;ng đồng &yacute; với quan điểm n&agrave;y.</li>\n<li>Ng&agrave;y nay, với sự ph&aacute;t triển của c&ocirc;ng nghệ, chất lượng h&igrave;nh ảnh v&agrave; &acirc;m thanh tr&ecirc;n TV v&agrave; m&aacute;y t&iacute;nh ng&agrave;y c&agrave;ng tốt. Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, trải nghiệm xem trực tiếp vẫn c&oacute; những điều đặc biệt ri&ecirc;ng. Đ&acirc;y l&agrave; một chủ đề th&uacute; vị để b&agrave;n luận về ưu nhược điểm của hai h&igrave;nh thức xem biểu diễn n&agrave;y.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CaaPdALkUoj39UxqBaClSdzHg7g\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2. Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n BODY&nbsp;</strong></span></h3>\n<ul style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li>Bạn ho&agrave;n to&agrave;n c&oacute; thể đồng &yacute; hoặc kh&ocirc;ng đồng &yacute; với quan điểm của đề nha. Ở đ&acirc;y, YouPass sẽ chọn quan điểm 'kh&ocirc;ng đồng &yacute;', ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh tin rằng xem biểu diễn trực tiếp vẫn tốt hơn xem qua TV hay m&aacute;y t&iacute;nh.</li>\n<li><strong style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol';\">Trong b&agrave;i Live Shows vs Screens,&nbsp;ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ lập luận theo c&aacute;ch 40/60 (balanced approach).</strong></li>\n<li>Để bảo vệ quan điểm 'kh&ocirc;ng đồng &yacute;', m&igrave;nh sẽ lập luận bằng c&aacute;ch si&ecirc;u đơn giản nhất c&oacute; thể. M&igrave;nh kh&ocirc;ng đồng &yacute; v&igrave; xem biểu diễn trực tiếp mang lại trải nghiệm đặc biệt v&agrave; cảm x&uacute;c m&atilde;nh liệt hơn nhiều so với xem qua TV (vế n&agrave;y m&igrave;nh sẽ viết ở BODY 2).</li>\n<li>Vậy th&igrave; BODY 1 m&igrave;nh viết c&aacute;i g&igrave; đ&acirc;y? M&igrave;nh sẽ b&agrave;n về những ưu điểm của việc xem biểu diễn qua TV hay m&aacute;y t&iacute;nh, tuy nhi&ecirc;n, m&igrave;nh n&oacute;i những ưu điểm n&agrave;y kh&ocirc;ng thể so s&aacute;nh được với trải nghiệm xem trực tiếp.</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O6Q8dKUwJolsRLxRHMKlYAGzgPb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3. Gợi &yacute; viết BODY 1</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ARYZdTorMo8GHUxXiaxlbgKog9K\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B3WzdXi90obr9exqY49ldT5Wg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T3vid37FgouPrLxntpAllbSOgpd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ABpydqwzqoBt8mxtA2clX4h8gmh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FRtld534aoXQ8Cxcdevl45SsgZc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OtESdRTjnoSJwzxYBWkl2MvDgXb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UaoQdMKTxottsFx5xHZl5y6dgTe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ShyKdSzwIoav15xhSR1lkgYvgiN\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RTBbdZqk5oiMqbxqVPDl0ghjgsp\">M&igrave;nh b&agrave;n về những ưu điểm của việc xem biểu diễn qua TV hay m&aacute;y t&iacute;nh.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RTBbdZqk5oiMqbxqVPDl0ghjgsp\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EujpdNz20ouTN6xvlM3lYQJcgFe\">Cấu tr&uacute;c đơn giản l&agrave;: Topic Sentence ➜ Supporting Idea 1 ➜ Supporting idea 2</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Topic sentence:</span></strong>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J2Mgd651jokGr5xFFcTlMHOagYg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YIkYdyyfZoikZgxMfM9ly4SYghh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mk2zdFhmloeQGbxZgDwlEsvwgnh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-JesqdVbvXoysYjxqtf7lyoDSg7c\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-S0GAd5xJ8oGcMrxuRAElpmNagXe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-R3fwdQRtuoEzr8xoXplloAFngIb\">Những người kh&ocirc;ng th&iacute;ch đ&aacute;m đ&ocirc;ng (<strong>crowded places</strong>) v&agrave; chỉ xem biểu diễn như một h&igrave;nh thức giải tr&iacute; th&ocirc;ng thường sẽ th&iacute;ch xem qua TV hơn.&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Supporting idea 1:&nbsp;</span></strong>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZSGudTTeHoUUbwxmgwvlnevNg0d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Br0HdPtt2o6yaDxssU5lFwBbgic\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CXHedb5Q5o0ChTxzjeJlACIHgBe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Qw7XdcQDiopHAmxbaJzlaWDZgjb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EAA1dQKV5otLAmxFGgBlpln2gIe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N5dHdBAjeojWA3xMEbCl8pn1gyB\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-IAbldxsOzoo2wFxmKA9lpeamg5g\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-QzOFdy5euouUfExkwLklHZeag1b\">Một số người cảm thấy kh&ocirc;ng thoải m&aacute;i (<strong>uncomfortable</strong>) ở nơi đ&ocirc;ng người v&agrave; ồn &agrave;o (<strong>noisy and crowded places</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-QzOFdy5euouUfExkwLklHZeag1b\">&nbsp; ➜ xem ở nh&agrave; qua TV l&agrave; lựa chọn hấp dẫn hơn</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-QzOFdy5euouUfExkwLklHZeag1b\">&nbsp; ➜ TV hiện đại c&oacute; chất lượng &acirc;m thanh v&agrave; h&igrave;nh ảnh tốt (<strong>high-quality sound and visual effects</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-QzOFdy5euouUfExkwLklHZeag1b\">&nbsp; ➜ mang lại trải nghiệm xem th&uacute; vị (<strong>pleasant experience</strong>)&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Supporting idea 2:</span></strong>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RJW5dfJhqofjuXxEd7dlCvwzg3b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LQSEdv0Y1oIVaoxMMoxljdOvgOd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HNQNdCbCpoystuxVP43luHtDgeb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HJ7FdScShoqf2QxHEgylSbaAgyf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NFfDdmOXNoOWwZxiNtZl15SMgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A0zKdQFrWoIXtex6mhplQSoegxb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-T2mWd1rtBo8T07x6awTlNUNqg9f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-JdqJdKI8BoGPTGxLus1lhqe1g5e\">Cuộc sống hiện đại bận rộn (<strong>fast-paced and busy working culture</strong>), &iacute;t ng&agrave;y nghỉ (<strong>fewer days off</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-JdqJdKI8BoGPTGxLus1lhqe1g5e\">&nbsp; ➜ kh&oacute; d&agrave;nh thời gian v&agrave; tiền bạc để đi xem biểu diễn trực tiếp</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-JdqJdKI8BoGPTGxLus1lhqe1g5e\">&nbsp; ➜ xem ở nh&agrave; tiết kiệm thời gian v&agrave; tiện lợi hơn (<strong>time-saving and convenient</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-JdqJdKI8BoGPTGxLus1lhqe1g5e\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I85fdLrlqovzpLxkUCfldUM5gEg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4. Gợi &yacute; viết BODY 2</strong> </span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I85fdLrlqovzpLxkUCfldUM5gEg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FkKtdjQLbo1AtlxkzyalC6VXgEc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZT8dluWuoiebixsy4zlDBdDg8f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ub8odKVWsohu3TxKHTylRfJ3gqT\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IO0OdZMbkop2KtxaAgbl07P0g3f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ap4ndJ97bocXozxn7oAl3Txmgte\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FwiNdcUNSoCW0UxEnPxlYn1NgYe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Lsjlde9EKo9cSdxAvmulNTZPgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EhKgd111SoDKWUxHkJAlyfRcgaf\">M&igrave;nh b&agrave;n về những trải nghiệm đặc biệt khi xem biểu diễn trực tiếp.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FOEmdrOKPo1bCBxguexlSXkMgIS\">Cấu tr&uacute;c đơn giản l&agrave;: Topic Sentence ➜ Supporting Idea 1 ➜ Supporting idea 2</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Topic sentence:</span></strong></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-ZakddQ7nJoAgFyxpFvNleucyg4d\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OBDmdoEGDoDyBgxNOqylocGigdc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PoBydy7ixoRrKIxO5gdlnQbzg7e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-FPwwd6a20oL0khxlV17lQP1fgSh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-CLHQd8Vyjoq587xOQKBlr5EDg4b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-HtHGdJZgvol64Kx25oBlq6BWg0N\">Xem biểu diễn trực tiếp mang lại trải nghiệm kh&oacute; qu&ecirc;n v&agrave; tinh thần tập thể (<strong>collective entertainment experience</strong>) m&agrave; xem ở nh&agrave; kh&ocirc;ng thể c&oacute; được.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Supporting idea 1:</span></strong>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OOMmd2z40oU1GpxeAiOljjORg6c\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-IP8udCf4UodaQ1xp6r1lvwiTgHc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-FWGcdCLrAodR0zx9hxultvvcg0c\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-JcusdZSFzovztExclQWl7chLg4e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q9rFdK1ipoSiH8x8Lc1lqPoUgYf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZa1dU6WtoYm51x9m3JlC8V6gQe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-G35adIotboSlwYxl0TulS1RkgJh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-WdEZdtJjQoMMiTxu4WJlqLUsgUc\">S&acirc;n khấu được trang tr&iacute; c&ocirc;ng phu (<strong>elaborate stage setups</strong>) v&agrave; hiệu ứng &aacute;nh s&aacute;ng ấn tượng (<strong>stunning lighting effects</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-WdEZdtJjQoMMiTxu4WJlqLUsgUc\">&nbsp; ➜ tạo ra bầu kh&ocirc;ng kh&iacute; s&ocirc;i động (<strong>electrifying atmosphere</strong>) đầy hứng khởi, đam m&ecirc; v&agrave; năng lượng</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-WdEZdtJjQoMMiTxu4WJlqLUsgUc\">&nbsp; ➜ tạo ra những kỷ niệm l&acirc;u d&agrave;i (<strong>lasting memories</strong>) m&agrave; xem qua TV kh&ocirc;ng thể c&oacute; được</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Supporting idea 2:</span></strong>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VZnEdzqc4oEV4wxO5mZluCDFgQd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BXimdSddLo8wilxpbXMli5xmgBf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CXfQd5foZotNYvxR3yulUfOegnb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JKs3d2HFfoJfLcxOlhZlsYPPgOc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OVGzda09ioegiAxjp4BlwN6Ugee\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Dc96dxi8Do6jiRxbpzIlbykXgw1\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-SmqNdAdGQozDyNxx9Ufl3QlCgZg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-XnIIdFwh0otgKsxovyplZxUBgig\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Xem biểu diễn trực tiếp mang lại tinh thần cộng đồng (<strong>sense of community</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-XnIIdFwh0otgKsxovyplZxUBgig\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp; ➜ cả người h&acirc;m mộ v&agrave; nghệ sĩ c&ugrave;ng nhau h&ograve;a m&igrave;nh v&agrave;o &acirc;m nhạc&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-XnIIdFwh0otgKsxovyplZxUBgig\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp; ➜ v&iacute; dụ: Tour diễn Eras của Taylor Swift thu h&uacute;t h&agrave;ng triệu người h&acirc;m mộ tr&ecirc;n to&agrave;n thế giới tới xem trực tiếp.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 85,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction ",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UzkgdybvlowI6jxqkEIlZxSogaf\">It is argued by some that there is no longer any need to attend live performances, because watching them on TV or computer screens is even better. <strong>While this opinion is reasonable to an extent, I believe that going to live concerts gives us a much more immersive experience.</strong></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 12870,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 86,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OtiDdXBOPoTY26xlktolWO9qgYd\"><strong>On the one hand, people who do not like to be in crowded places, and those who view shows merely as a form of relaxation, would most reasonably choose to watch concerts on TV. </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">Firstly, being in noisy and crowded places causes some individuals to feel uncomfortable, making the option of watching concerts at home more appealing. Watching performances at home can also offer a pleasant experience thanks to high-quality sound and visual effects that today&rsquo;s TVs come equipped with.<span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"> </span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">Moreover, in today&rsquo;s fast-paced and busy working culture, people are given fewer days off. Therefore, being able to set aside enough time and money to attend concerts has become something of a luxury that not many can afford, while enjoying shows at home is a more time-saving and convenient form of entertainment.</span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OtiDdXBOPoTY26xlktolWO9qgYd\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 12870,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 87,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 2 ",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Gv3EdOyzFowlsixKbd5lZqaYgvh\"><strong>On the other hand, attending a live concert offers fans an unforgettable and collective entertainment experience unmatched by simply enjoying it from home.</strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">Elaborate stage setups and stunning lighting effects are crucial elements that enhance artists&rsquo; performances. This produces an electrifying atmosphere filled with excitement, passion and energy, creating lasting memories that TV broadcasts cannot fully capture.<span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"> </span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">In addition, a sense of community and fulfillment can be built among those involved, as both fans and artists enjoy live shows together. This is exemplified by the popularity of Taylor Swift's Eras Tour, which has attracted millions of fans worldwide to attend concerts in various countries.</span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 12870,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 88,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Conclusion ",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Du5jdX39xotTihxU0MjlVuvzgdg\">In conclusion, people who are not able to attend concerts can enjoy the shows on high-tech TVs with vibrant colors and high quality sound systems. However, going to concerts offers fans unique experiences and a feeling of belonging that cannot be replicated at home.</div>\n</div>",
